{
    "title": "Thanksgiving",
    "description": "\ud83e\udd83 Elevate your Thanksgiving celebration with the Thanksgiving Wear OS watchface! \ud83c\udf41 Immerse yourself in the festive spirit with a charming turkey centerpiece and a delightful pumpkin. \ud83c\udf89\r\n\r\n\u231a This watchface offers both 12 and 24-hour digital clocks, ensuring you stay punctual during the holiday hustle. \ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Stay connected with the date displayed in English, and monitor your health with heart rate and steps tracking right on your wrist. \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udcc5\r\n\r\n\u2728 Customization is key! Enjoy 2 fully customizable complications to effortlessly access a plethora of information, from weather updates and battery status to notifications, sunrise, sunset, and beyond. \ud83c\udf05\ud83c\udf19\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Explore the beauty of fall with 25 exquisite color themes, each carefully curated to capture the essence of autumn. \ud83c\udf42 Whether you prefer warm hues or earthy tones, there's a palette to suit every style.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0b Worried about power consumption? Fear not! Our custom Always-On Display (AOD) design is optimized for low power usage, ensuring your watch lasts as long as the Thanksgiving festivities. \ud83e\udd83\ud83d\udd0b\r\n\r\nDress your wrist in the spirit of gratitude and celebration with the Thanksgiving watchface \u2013 where functionality meets festivity! \ud83c\udf42\ud83c\udf1f\r\n\r\nTo customize the watchface:\r\n1. Press and hold on the display\r\n2. Tap the Customize button to change the color theme for time, date and stats, data for complications to display.\r\n\r\nDon't forget: use the companion app on your phone to discover other amazing watchfaces made by us!\r\n\r\n*** Check out the Autumn and Halloween Collection: https://starwatchfaces.com/wearos/collection/autumn-collection/ ***\r\n\r\nFor more watchfaces, visit our website or download our app, \"Watch faces for Wear OS\" to see all our watchfaces: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.starwatchfaces.watchfaces\r\n\r\nEnjoy!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83e\udd83 Elevate your Thanksgiving celebration with the Thanksgiving Wear OS watchface! \ud83c\udf41 Immerse yourself in the festive spirit with a charming turkey centerpiece and a delightful pumpkin. \ud83c\udf89<br><br>\u231a This watchface offers both 12 and 24-hour digital clocks, ensuring you stay punctual during the holiday hustle. \ud83d\udd70\ufe0f Stay connected with the date displayed in English, and monitor your health with heart rate and steps tracking right on your wrist. \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udcc5<br><br>\u2728 Customization is key! Enjoy 2 fully customizable complications to effortlessly access a plethora of information, from weather updates and battery status to notifications, sunrise, sunset, and beyond. \ud83c\udf05\ud83c\udf19<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Explore the beauty of fall with 25 exquisite color themes, each carefully curated to capture the essence of autumn. \ud83c\udf42 Whether you prefer warm hues or earthy tones, there&#39;s a palette to suit every style.<br><br>\ud83d\udd0b Worried about power consumption? Fear not! Our custom Always-On Display (AOD) design is optimized for low power usage, ensuring your watch lasts as long as the Thanksgiving festivities. \ud83e\udd83\ud83d\udd0b<br><br>Dress your wrist in the spirit of gratitude and celebration with the Thanksgiving watchface \u2013 where functionality meets festivity! \ud83c\udf42\ud83c\udf1f<br><br>To customize the watchface:<br>1. Press and hold on the display<br>2. Tap the Customize button to change the color theme for time, date and stats, data for complications to display.<br><br>Don&#39;t forget: use the companion app on your phone to discover other amazing watchfaces made by us!<br><br>*** Check out the Autumn and Halloween Collection: https://starwatchfaces.com/wearos/collection/autumn-collection/ ***<br><br>For more watchfaces, visit our website or download our app, &quot;Watch faces for Wear OS&quot; to see all our watchfaces: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.starwatchfaces.watchfaces<br><br>Enjoy!",
